;    0: TWdLink(count=4215, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\取調室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Sit down and wait. 
{PAUSE ""}
Right now, as it happens, the important person in charge of the healthy development of young people for the prefecture is here."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
With that, the old guy left the room.<PG>
Is this an interrogation room?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's a little different from what I'd imagined.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's bare, but instead of a crude desk and folding chairs, it's more like a guidance counselor's office...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
Then, before long, the door to the room opened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "伊勢.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The one who appeared there was past 30, maybe?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His face is well-proportioned, handsome-ish.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Age gap aside, he might be pretty much my type.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If he's in the healthy development of young people, he must be used to handling runaway girls, too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "0" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア早い開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But he immediately went back into the hallway and slammed the door shut.<PG>
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Wh-wh-what was that pretty girl just now!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Calm down! You must calm down!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　What I must do is the wholesome development of a pretty girl, and never, ever look at her with sexual eyes!"</STYLE><PG>
Through the door comes muttering that even my hearing can barely make out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア早い開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Then, this time, the door is flung open.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Y-y-y-</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> theeere!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　What an indecent thing for a pretty girl to do!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Pardon?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is he talking about...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the look of things, <STYLE ID="2">this man</STYLE> is a lolicon too...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, there's the example of that old guy earlier.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This man</STYLE> seems to be a pro at handling runaway girls, so that's probably not it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"N-n-n-name ish, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Furumura aaah </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Akina</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, is that right!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Y... yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Swept along by his momentum, I answered to the false name.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I thought about correcting it, but 
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\バース\伊勢うつむくバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">the man</STYLE> is looking down a little, trembling all over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's hard to say anything to him...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Wh- </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">wh- </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">wh- </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Where you're from, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">is it really I-i-i-Iizawa Prefecture!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"I-i-i-if that's a lie, who are </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">His breathing, the trembling of his body, the cold sweat―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">this man</STYLE> is very nervous.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A lolicon after all...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, going by the old guy earlier, they make themselves look like lolicons.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I won't fall for that. I steel myself again.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"S-sorry! Actually, I came from Motoki-cho in Sawa Prefecture!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Seizing the chance, I lie about where I'm from.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because if I told the truth, I might get sent back to Iizawa Prefecture.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By the way, I said Motoki-cho because I remembered it's where <STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE>, who's in the <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="さんろう">mountain seclusion</STYLE> now, used to live.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"M-m-m-Motoki-cho!? A rare find like this has been buried there all this time!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He saw through to my being a rare find!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's true, at hunting I'm second to none.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that clearly doesn't fit the flow of the conversation; he must mean something else.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\バース\伊勢うつむくバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Phew... calm down, man..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um... could you tell me your name!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"M-m-my name!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, he snaps his back straight and fixes me with a sharp look.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ahem! Sawa Prefectural Police, Motoki Police Station―Inspector Daijiro Ise!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　And though I may not look it, I'm a director on the Sawa Prefecture Committee for the Healthy Development of Young People!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\警察手帳.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
And he snaps his police badge out in front of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Inspector, and director―those titles.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This man</STYLE> might really be someone important.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"A-anyway... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">His Majesty the Emperor's security detail is done, so I must return to Motoki-cho as well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Y-</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> live in Motoki-cho, correct!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes... well..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\バース\伊勢うつむくバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"Th-th-th-then!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　T-t-t-together... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">let's go home together!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Home?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢驚きバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"N-n-n-n-n-no, not home―HOME!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　You know, that thing! You call your own town your hometown, so, home!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I mean HOME!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"U-uh-huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't tell if he's full of bluster or has stage fright.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or rather, his talk is so scattered I can't get a grip on what kind of person he is.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And he's just my type to look at, too... what a waste.<PG>
Either way, this person called <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> will probably take me to Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Honestly, I've never even set foot in Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have a feeling my runaway drama is going to be far more eventful than I imagined.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"A-a-a-a-anyway, the rest of this conversation shall take place at Motoki Police Station!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　By the way... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">how's your stomach?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"My stomach?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"N-n-no, um, that is, er... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">have you eaten?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, I haven't eaten anything yet today.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's already 3 p.m.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At those words my stomach reacts, and I start to feel a little hungry.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, not yet."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"G-good! Then the meal shall take place on the way to Motoki-cho!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Any objections... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">do you have any objection to a meal with me!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently he's going to <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ちそう">treat</STYLE> me to a meal.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The consideration from this <STYLE ID="2">man acting so suspiciously</STYLE> makes me just a little happy.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"N-no! No objections!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"G-good! Well said! Food and sleep are what drive a human being!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　A pretty girl, after all, must be wholesome and healthy!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Calling me a pretty girl aside, what does 'wholesome and healthy' mean?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oh, right, <STYLE ID="2">this man</STYLE> is a director on the Committee for the Healthy Development of Young People.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―After that, <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> and I got into an ordinary car that didn't look like a police car at first glance, and set off for Motoki-cho.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\伊勢運転.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
From <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="みなかみし">Minakami City</STYLE> to Motoki-cho is about 2 hours on the expressway, apparently.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With a meal along the way, it'll probably be evening by the time we arrive.<PG>
But there's no sign at all of us getting on the expressway.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Beside the national route we're driving on, I can see the expressway we're supposed to take.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No answer from <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He just keeps looking ahead with serious eyes, driving at a safe speed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since he's a police officer, he doesn't talk while driving, for safety's sake?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, he should at least respond to small talk.<PG>
{QUAKE "" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Um, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">!?"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Wh-wh-what!? Shouting all of a sudden...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I've been calling you for a while now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I-I-I-I-I see! What do you want!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "伊勢.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "5000" "PASS"}
Seems he just wasn't listening.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Aren't you getting on the </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="こうそく">expressway</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Wha!? R-</STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="こうそく">restraints</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you say!?</STYLE> [TN: kosoku 'expressway' and kosoku 'restraint' sound the same]
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　How indecent! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, such an </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="いたいけ">innocent</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> young girl, shouldn't say such things!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For some reason, I got scolded.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is 'expressway' some kind of police slang?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um... aren't you getting on the highway?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Highway? You mean the expressway!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　In that case... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　We already passed it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is <STYLE ID="2">this man</STYLE> really okay?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"W-while we're at it, we'll stop at a diner up ahead. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It's a place I go to a lot, so I guarantee the taste."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Um, why are you so nervous?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Wh-wh-what!? I am not nervous!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I ab nod nerbous...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now he's started <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="か">tripping</STYLE> over his words...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If he keeps driving like this, he could cause an accident.<PG>
At times like this... 
{PAUSE ""}
yeah, it'd be best for me to help loosen up his nerves.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">Mommy</STYLE> said that at times like this, it's good to ask lots of questions and wait for the worries to slip out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Okay! I'll give it a try too!<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, why did you decide to become a police officer?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Wh-what's this, all of a sudden...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh... I just thought it'd be nice to talk, since we have the chance."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">are interested in me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Interest, or... how should I put it...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I just don't want him to be nervous, that's all.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes! On a journey, a companion; in the world, kindness!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　In the spirit of ichigo ichie, always spread smiles around!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> used to say that a lot!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I-I see... The reason I became a police officer... </STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> probably wouldn't know, but back when I was a student, Motoki-cho didn't have that many people..."</STYLE><PG>
The nervousness that had him fidgeting until now suddenly turns into a taut, serious tension.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't know much about Motoki-cho, but it looks like I can steer the talk in a good direction.<PG>
{PLAYSND "Talking_Time.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"But around when I turned 20, the atmosphere in Motoki-cho suddenly started to change. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">A lot more people started moving in for the famous cherry blossoms. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">When the population grows, public order inevitably tends to get worse. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So I became a police officer because I wanted to keep the peace in Motoki-cho."</STYLE><PG>
It was a surprisingly serious answer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since he holds an important post at his age, he must have done a great deal for Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He must be a model police officer, not just in words but in deeds.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you're the one protecting the peace of Motoki-cho. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It must be a nice place..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oops. What I just said gives away completely that I don't live in Motoki-cho.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, I'll ask where </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> came from once we get to Motoki-cho. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Prying it out of you recklessly wouldn't lead to the wholesome development of young people."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What's </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> real name?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kana Niimura..."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Niimura?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing my real name, a slightly <STYLE ID="16" RUBY="けげん">dubious</STYLE> look from <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Earlier </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said Motoki-cho must be a nice place... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And it's true, normally it's a nice place. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But 4 years ago a vicious crime occurred, and the suspect disappeared with a child."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
There really was a case like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My friends at school said it was deeply connected to the Megasawa City case...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"The suspect's surname was 'Niimura.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">We're still on </STYLE><STYLE ID="17">that person</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s trail, but there's been no lead at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="18" RUBY="いいざわけん">Iizawa Prefecture's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> Arata district was another guess, but that missed too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The Iizawa Prefectural Police searched the whole settlement, but in the end they came up empty."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="19" RUBY="いいざわけん">Iizawa Prefecture's</STYLE> Arata district means none other than the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had no idea there'd been an investigation like that.<PG>
But 4 years ago, two people with the surname Niimura did come to the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">Auntie</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now they're in the <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="さんろう">mountain seclusion</STYLE> and not in the settlement.<BR>
No matter how much you search the settlement, you'd never find them.<PG>
Should I tell <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> about this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The suspect <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> means must be <STYLE ID="17">Auntie</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm sure <STYLE ID="2">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="15">Mommy</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="20">Grandma</STYLE>, who's passed away, have all been hiding <STYLE ID="17">Auntie</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Considering that, for me to say anything...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"The investigation is mostly winding down now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But people I know are still earnestly hoping that the child who was taken will come back. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I can't just cut off their hopes that easily. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If I give up here, the peaceful Motoki-cho I wanted would..."</STYLE><PG>
In this case, which side is justice on?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Do I tell him where <STYLE ID="17">Auntie</STYLE> and Haruka-chan are, or do I keep quiet?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even I know that I ought to tell him.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But as long as the whole settlement is hiding <STYLE ID="17">Auntie</STYLE>, I have a duty to do the same.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One for all, all for one.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> have the same surname, and at first you said you were from </STYLE><STYLE ID="18" RUBY="いいざわけん">Iizawa Prefecture</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, close to the Arata district. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Do you... know anything...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">don't know. I don't know anything..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see... It's not that rare a surname. I guess I'm stretching it too far..."</STYLE><PG>
